flowchart LR
    N0["1. Read historical evidence<br/>Contract calls<br/>Receipts & event logs<br/>Token transfers & fees<br/>Protocol state"]
    N1["2. Find repeatable behavior<br/>Match known seed actions<br/>Reconstruct the sequence<br/>Compare repeated executions"]
    N0 --> N1
    N2["3. Identify strategy wallets<br/>Keep the actual executor<br/>Attach the evidence<br/>Build a research shortlist"]
    N1 --> N2
    N3["4. Observe fresh activity<br/>Read new transactions<br/>Compare with wallet history<br/>Recheck protocol conditions"]
    N2 --> N3
    N4["5. Form a new Alpha candidate<br/>Describe the possible mechanism<br/>Attach supporting executions<br/>Write a checkable hypothesis"]
    N3 --> N4
    N5["6. Validate and learn<br/>Test evidence, costs, and current state<br/>Produce a report for every candidate<br/>Expand only after validation"]
    N4 --> N5
    N5 -. "Use an established mechanism as a new seed; repeat with fresh evidence." .-> N0
